  m_Name: The Farwatch Pilgrimage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: DiceFree.Quests.Runtime::DiceFree.Quests.QuestDefinition
  stableId: quest.marksman.world-tour
  title: The Farwatch Pilgrimage
  category: 0
  requiredClassId: class.ranger
  requiredLevel: 60
  version: 1
  offer: 'The whole world is your shooting range. I have placed one target in each town and city: Cornberg, Trimery, Arborium, Cinderwatch, Willowford and Anvilreach. Visit both worlds and strike each target with an ordinary bow shot. Your journal will keep the list. Return to me when all six are struck.'
  activeDialogue: Six settlements, two worlds. Check your journal for the places you still need. The targets stand in the open near the roads; this is a journey, not a hunt for a hidden speck.
  turnInDialogue: You have learned to see the world beyond a single hunting ground. Take the path of the Marksman.
  locationHint: Aelwen waits at the woodland edge south of Willowford in Steamroot Vale.
  turnInHint: Return to Aelwen, the Farwatch, south of Willowford.
